  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  notesText: "You can use a Slider as for input, or (as in this case) as a way to
    privde information to the player.\n\nWhen adding a Slider to your GUI, you will
    most likely be adding via a menu (GameObject-> UI -> Slider).  \n\nIf you are
    using purely relative positioning, you will need to zero out the absolute coordinates
    in all the nested RectTransforms that Unity creates."
